  "caveats": [
    "Two counties are unsettled in state law and are marked settled=false. In those, a county private act and the general statute point at different offices, or a court is mid-transition, and no public record resolves it.",
    "Phone numbers proved the most durable field and addresses the least. Addresses are given only in notes, and only where a county's own site publishes them.",
    "Where a compiled private act and a county's own current website disagree, this follows the website, because it describes what happens at the counter."
